{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramAddCell","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramAddCell","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramAddable"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.addCellOrSelf_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.addCellOrSelf_of","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L171-L172","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.addCellOrSelf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.addCellOrSelf","kind":"def","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L165-L169","doc":"**`addCell` made total in the cell.**  A summand quantified over *all* cells cannot mention\n`addCell ν s hs`, which needs the addability proof; this is the version that can appear there, and\n`addCellOrSelf_of` recovers the real thing wherever the proof is available. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.instDecidableIsAddableCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.instDecidableIsAddableCell","kind":"instance","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L161-L163","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.cornerAddEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.cornerAddEquiv","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L133-L158","doc":"**The outer branching exchange.**  `(λ, removable corner) ↔ (λ ∖ c, that corner as an addable\none)`.  Phrasing both sides as subtypes of one product type — rather than as `Sigma`s over the\ndiagram — keeps the equality proofs at `Subtype.ext`, with no `HEq` transport. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.AddPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.AddPair","kind":"def","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L129-L131","doc":"A diagram of size `n` together with one of its addable corners. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.CornerPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.CornerPair","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L125-L127","doc":"A diagram of size `n + 1` together with one of its removable corners. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.isAddableCell_eraseCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.isAddableCell_eraseCorner","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L96-L111","doc":"A removable corner is addable to the erased diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.addCell_eraseCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.addCell_eraseCorner","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L80-L94","doc":"Erasing then adding is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.eraseCorner_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.eraseCorner_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L67-L78","doc":"Adding then erasing is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.isCornerCell_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.isCornerCell_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramAddCell.lean#L54-L65","doc":"The added cell is a removable corner of the result. ","signatureChunk":0}]}